### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/users

### Admin Token (REQUIRED for all requests)
@adminToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6IjY5ZDA5OTZkODIwNGU4MzE2ZTNkNzc2YiIsImlhdCI6MTc3NTI3OTIzMSwiZXhwIjoxNzc1ODg0MDMxfQ.fG6Q-8guQ5T9lCkwOn72Hr4Gbbw3BXB51Jm1QrqS0zQ

### =========================
### 1. Get All Users (Pagination)
### =========================
GET {{baseUrl}}?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### =========================
### 2. Get User By ID
### =========================
GET {{baseUrl}}/69d09a9b9fcead5793efba75
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### =========================
### 3. Update User (role / status / name)
### =========================
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/69d09a9b9fcead5793efba75
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "name": "Updated Name",
  "role": "viewer",
  "status": "active"
}


### =========================
### 4. Update Only Role
### =========================
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/69d09a9b9fcead5793efba75
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "role": "admin"
}


### =========================
### 5. Update Only Status
### =========================
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/69d09a9b9fcead5793efba75
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "status": "inactive"
}


### =========================
### 6. Delete User
### =========================
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/69d0996d8204e8316e3d776c
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}